t.status (Order complaint)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;Open, OperatorResponded, Escalated, Resolved, Rejected&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;kept (regrouped)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;UC31, UC32&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;Complaint.mmd&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;Orders (Nhân)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;4.20&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;color:#64748b&quot;&gt;4.23&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;operator.status (Farm operator)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;Draft, Submitted, Approved, Rejected, Suspended&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;kept&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;UC04, UC05&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;Operator.mmd&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;Operators (Viên)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;4.21&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;color:#64748b&quot;&gt;4.24&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;physical_slot.status (Box)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;Available, Occupied, Maintenance&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;modified + «planned» (box rows, row-scoped view)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;UC17, UC22, UC44&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;Box.mmd&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;Boxes (Viên) · Production, Harvest (Viên)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;4.22&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;color:#64748b&quot;&gt;4.25&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;standard_cost_version.status (Standard Cost)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;Draft, Submitted, Locked, Superseded, &lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;Approved*&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;modified + «planned» (locked with price per kg and floor price)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;UC07, UC08&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;StandardCostVersion.mmd&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;Batches (Viên)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;4.23&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;color:#64748b&quot;&gt;4.26&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;crab_item.status (Crab in a box)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;Growing, InStock, Packed, Sold, Dead, &lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;DeliveredInKind*&lt;/font&gt;, &lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;Lost*&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;modified + «planned» (no tags, transit loss, resale)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;UC17, UC22, UC29, UC30, UC50, UC51&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;CrabItem.mmd&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;Production, Harvest (Viên) · Orders (Nhân)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;4.24&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;color:#64748b&quot;&gt;4.28&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;harvest.lifecycle_status (Harvest session)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;Open, Completed&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;modified + «planned» (per box, no tags)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;UC22&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;Harvest.mmd&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;Harvest (Viên)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;4.25&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;color:#64748b&quot;&gt;4.29&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;app_user.status (User account)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;Active, Locked, &lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;PendingVerification*&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;kept&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;UC01&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;AppUser.mmd&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;Auth (Thiện) · Accounts (Khôi)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;4.26&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;color:#64748b&quot;&gt;4.30&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;investor.verification_status (eKYC)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;Unverified, Verified, Rejected&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;kept&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;UC01, UC02, UC06&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;InvestorVerification.mmd&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;Accounts (Khôi)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;4.27&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;color:#64748b&quot;&gt;4.31&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;payout_account.status (+ name_match_status)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;Active, Locked, Closed&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;kept (redrawn with a choice)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;UC03&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;PayoutAccount.mmd&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;Accounts (Khôi)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;4.28&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;color:#64748b&quot;&gt;4.32&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;evidence.review_status (Production evidence)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;Accepted, Watch, Flagged, Rejected&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;modified + «planned» (simulator input, row-scoped view)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;UC45, UC47, UC48&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;Evidence.mmd&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;Evidence (Khôi)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;4.29&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;color:#64748b&quot;&gt;4.33&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;capture_request.status (Random capture request)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;Open, Fulfilled, Expired&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;kept&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;UC45&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;CaptureRequest.mmd&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;Evidence (Khôi)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;4.30&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;color:#64748b&quot;&gt;4.34&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;alert.status (Operations alert)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;Open, Acknowledged, Escalated, Resolved&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;modified (alert types, regrouped)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;UC19, UC20&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;Alert.mmd&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;Alerts (Khôi)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="100" width="1610" height="687" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="Index (2 of 2)" id="Index__2_of_2_"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Index (2/2) – State Machine Diagrams: removed machines, classifications, planned entities, legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5.1 · states = CHECK values + «planned» · label: trigger [guard] / effect · UC&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1600" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="&lt;b&gt;Removed in v1.4 (still in code) — not drawn any more&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• product_listing.status (v2.0 Figure 4.17): Draft, Published, SoldOut, Closed — Listing / Catalog: retail listings removed (UC24). Table, CHECK and services remain in V001–V017 and develop; they stay in the physical ERD.&lt;br&gt;• stock_reservation.status (v2.0 Figure 4.19): Active, Committed, Released — Cart / checkout stock hold on a listing removed (UC26); v1.4 holds pre-ordered crabs with PreOrderHold «planned». Table, CHECK and services remain in V001–V017 and develop; they stay in the physical ERD.&lt;br&gt;• offtake_commitment.status (v2.0 Figure 4.21): PendingHarvest, WindowOpen, Fulfilled, Expired, Cancelled — Offtake window removed (UC13, UC23). Table, CHECK and services remain in V001–V017 and develop; they stay in the physical ERD.&lt;br&gt;• offtake_commitment.deposit_status (v2.0 Figure 4.22): Pending, Held, Applied, Forfeited, Refunded — Offtake deposit removed with the window. Table, CHECK and services remain in V001–V017 and develop; they stay in the physical ERD.&lt;br&gt;• crab_tag.status (v2.0 Figure 4.27): Printed, Active, Void — CrabTag: per-crab printed tags removed (UC46). Table, CHECK and services remain in V001–V017 and develop; they stay in the physical ERD.&lt;br&gt;• alert.alert_type values WaterQuality (pH, temperature and salinity of daily logs against ProductionThresholdVersion, the water-quality thresholds) and LowStock (listing stock): no longer raised in v1.4; the measurements and thresholds are removed too. Code, tables and the CHECK remain; the alert lifecycle (Figure 4.30) is unchanged for the other types.&lt;br&gt;• sales_order.status value Paid (v2.0 Figures 4.18, 4.20): written today by retail checkout and by the pre-order balance paid before packing; v1.4 pays the balance at delivery (Shipping → Delivered, Figure 4.17) and invoiced sales go PendingPayment → Completed (Figure 4.18). The value stays in ck_sales_order_status and the code." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#94a3b8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="100" width="1610" height="172" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4" value="&lt;b&gt;Status columns or values without a diagram (classifications, not lifecycles)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• provider_transaction.match_status: Matched, Unmatched, LatePayment — set once when the webhook is booked, never changes.&lt;br&gt;• contract_template.status, risk_disclosure.status: Draft, Active, Retired — document versioning by seed or admin data, no API transitions.&lt;br&gt;• payout_account.name_match_status: Pending, Matched, Mismatched — written together with payout_account.status (Figure 4.27).&lt;br&gt;• harvest_record.tag_status: immutable snapshot, always Printed at recording time (trigger tr_harvest_record_immutable); crab tags are removed in v1.4.&lt;br&gt;• harvest.lifecycle_status NULL: rows created before V016 (read-only history), not a business state (Figure 4.24).&lt;br&gt;• kyc_check.result: Pending, Passed, Failed, ExceptionApproved — one row per check; only Failed → ExceptionApproved changes (UC06)." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#94a3b8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="288" width="1610" height="127" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="5" value="&lt;b&gt;«planned» v1.4 entities and values&lt;/b&gt; (none exists in code yet)&lt;br&gt;• RowAllocation.status ∈ {Held, Allocated, Released}: drawn as a separate «planned» machine (frame stm RowAllocation) on Figure 4.9 because it follows the contribution. BoxRow belongs to a batch (its boxes grouped by physical_slot.row_code); a confirmed row belongs to exactly one investor; Contribution 1–N RowAllocation, at most one active allocation per row.&lt;br&gt;• sales_order planned values: BulkPreOrder adds Confirmed, Refunded and Forfeited, and Cancelled keeps a paid deposit until funding closes (Figure 4.17, UC54); orderType ∈ {BulkPreOrder, InvoicedSale, FinalOrder}, InvoicedSale.saleReason ∈ {LowGrade, ForfeitResale} (Figure 4.18).&lt;br&gt;• PreOrderQuota (batch_preorder_quota) and PreOrderHold (preorder_hold): the batch's crabs open for pre-order and the hold of each order (Figure 4.17); Batch.SalesWindowDays closes the sales window (Figure 4.8).&lt;br&gt;• RemunerationTier: approved with the batch (UC08) and locked; Invoice: one per delivered order (BulkPreOrder, InvoicedSale, FinalOrder); OrderQrCode: issued when the Operator prepares the delivery note; RevenueLine.type ∈ {DeliveredOrder, InvoicedSale, ForfeitedDeposit, FinalOrder}, immutable lines of a settlement (Figure 4.14).&lt;br&gt;• PriceObservation, PriceSuggestion (UC49): data and computed ranges, no lifecycle. IngestionMessage (UC52): accepted or rejected once at receipt. HarvestRecord exists since V016 and is append-only." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#94a3b8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="431" width="1610" height="142" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="6" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;Legend: solid = implemented on develop · dashed grey «planned» = Register v1.4, not in code yet (grey text on a solid transition = planned guard or effect) · dashed orange &quot;(not written by code)&quot; = value allowed by the CHECK constraint but never written · parts removed in v1.4 are not drawn (see Notes and the Index). UC codes follow the v1.4 use case list (UC13, UC23, UC24, UC26, UC46 removed; UC49–UC55 new; UC54 = Forfeit Deposit, UC55 = Cancel Bulk Pre-order). Design decisions of 05/11/2026 were confirmed by the lead; they are applied on Figures 4.8, 4.9, 4.11, 4.12, 4.14, 4.17, 4.18, 4.21, 4.22, 4.23. Initial transitions carry only an effect (&quot;/ created by …&quot;); creation preconditions are listed in each page's Notes.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#94a3b8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="589" width="1610" height="67" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="batch.status" id="batch_status"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.8 – State Machine Diagram: batch.status (Batch)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5.1 · states = CHECK values + «planned» · label: trigger [guard] / effect · UC · modified + «planned» (Register v1.4)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1600" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Source (develop @ 420a379, V001–V017):&lt;/b&gt; BatchService.CreateAsync/SubmitAsync · BatchReviewService.ApproveAsync/RejectAsync/RequestRevisionAsync · FundingCloseJob → FundingCloseService.CloseBatchAsync · StockingService.StockAsync · HarvestService.StartAsync · SettlementService.CalculateAsync · SettlementClosing.CloseIfPaidAsync · &lt;b&gt;Module:&lt;/b&gt; Batches, Production, Harvest (Viên) · Funding, Settlement (Thiện)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="58" width="1600" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="&lt;b&gt;Harvesting&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#475569&quot;&gt;DB value · contains «planned» business phases derived from the order states (not status values)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#3730a3;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fontSize=14;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="660" width="1040" height="210" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="Draft" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="110" y="220" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="PendingApproval" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="400" y="220" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="Rejected" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="400" y="470" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="Funding&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#475569&quot;&gt;do / reservations (UC10)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» do / bulk pre-orders (UC27)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="690" y="205" width="300" height="69" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="863" y="400" width="34" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="Cancelled" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="790" y="530" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="Stocked&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#475569&quot;&gt;transient&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1090" y="220" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="InProduction" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1380" y="220" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned»&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Delivering&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;business phase, not a status value&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#475569&quot;&gt;do / harvest per box (UC22)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#475569&quot;&gt;do / deliver, weigh, pay balance (UC29, UC30)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#475569&quot;&gt;do / invoiced sales (UC50)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;fillColor=#f8fafc;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="c4"><mxGeometry x="80" y="70" width="320" height="112" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned»&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;FinalOrder&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;business phase, not a status value&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#475569&quot;&gt;entry / final-order reminder (job)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#475569&quot;&gt;do / final order ≥ floor price (UC51)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;fillColor=#f8fafc;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="c4"><mxGeometry x="690" y="75" width="300" height="98" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="Settlement" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="240" y="748" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="Closed" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="748" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=startState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="44" y="237" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=startState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="c4"><mxGeometry x="24" y="103" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="478" y="576" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c20" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1030" y="547" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="98" y="854" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="22" value="/ created by&lt;br&gt;create batch&lt;br&gt;(Owner) · UC07" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c17" target="c5"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="-1" y="78" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="23" value="submit (Owner) [Standard&lt;br&gt;Cost Draft with&lt;br&gt;MortalityReserve, schedule&lt;br&gt;complete] / cost version&lt;br&gt;Submitted · UC07&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» [price per kg&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;(UC49 hint), floor price,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;survival threshold and&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;tiers, delivery radius set]&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c6"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="121" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="24" value="request revision (Admin) [reason] / next save&lt;br&gt;creates a new cost version · UC08" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c5"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="460" y="160"/><mxPoint x="190" y="160"/></Array><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="25" value="reject (Admin)&lt;br&gt;[reason] /&lt;br&gt;rejection_reason ·&lt;br&gt;UC08" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c7"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="26" value="approve (Admin) [operator&lt;br&gt;Approved, one Submitted cost&lt;br&gt;version, fee tier matches] /&lt;br&gt;lock Standard Cost, batch&lt;br&gt;account Open, tranches&lt;br&gt;Planned, funding window ·&lt;br&gt;UC08&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» also approve floor&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;price and remuneration&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;tiers; lock price per kg and&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;floor price; snapshot the&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;minimum pre-order ratio&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;(UC41)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c8"><mxGeometry x="0.640" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="5" y="152" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="27" value="funding close (job)&lt;br&gt;at deadline or max&lt;br&gt;capital · UC10" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;exitX=0.633;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c8" target="c9"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="-58" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="28" value="[confirmed ≥&lt;br&gt;min_viable_capital AND&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;pre-order ratio ≥&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;minimum «planned»&lt;/font&gt;] /&lt;br&gt;capital_share snapshot,&lt;br&gt;capital_closed_at" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.9;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c9" target="c8"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="960" y="417"/></Array><mxPoint x="73" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="29" value="[else] / refund every&lt;br&gt;Confirmed contribution &lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;and&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;every customer deposit&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned»&lt;/font&gt;, void unsigned&lt;br&gt;contracts" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c9" target="c10"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="30" value="record stocking (Owner) [capital closed, every&lt;br&gt;contract FullySigned, boxes = seed_quantity, all&lt;br&gt;Available] / boxes Occupied, crabs Growing ·&lt;br&gt;UC17&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» only the funded boxes are stocked&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c8" target="c11"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="3" y="-96" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="31" value="/ same&lt;br&gt;transaction&lt;br&gt;· UC17" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c11" target="c12"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="32" value="start harvest (Owner)&lt;br&gt;[no Open harvest&lt;br&gt;session] / harvest Open,&lt;br&gt;harvest_started_at ·&lt;br&gt;UC22" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.875;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c12" target="c4"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="33" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c18" target="c13"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="34" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned»&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;after(SalesWindowDays)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;[harvest Completed] /&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;final-order reminder&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;(job) · UC51&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c13" target="c14"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="35" value="run settlement&lt;br&gt;calculation (Admin&lt;br&gt;triggers, engine&lt;br&gt;computes) [capital&lt;br&gt;shares, Locked cost]&lt;br&gt;/ settlement Draft ·&lt;br&gt;UC38&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» [final&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;order recorded ∧&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;every order past its&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;return window]&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c15"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="36" value="last investor payout&lt;br&gt;Succeeded /&lt;br&gt;settlement PaidOut →&lt;br&gt;Closed, closed_at ·&lt;br&gt;UC39, UC40" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c15" target="c16"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="-92" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="37" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c19"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="38" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c10" target="c20"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="39" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c16" target="c21"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="40" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Created by create batch (Owner) only if: the Owner's operator is Approved (UC07).&lt;br&gt;• Rules live in the services (422 batch.invalid_transition); the database only checks the value list (ck_batch_status) — the architecture notes in the repository describe a DB trigger that does not exist.&lt;br&gt;• Funding closes when the minimum viable capital is reached (as in code) and, «planned», the minimum pre-order ratio; Funding keeps its value (capital_closed_at set). «planned» if capital closes between the minimum and the target, only the funded boxes go into production, capital that cannot be converted into boxes is refunded, and settlement deducts the locked Standard Cost of the funded boxes only.&lt;br&gt;• Today in code, submit and approve also need an offtake price per grade and pre-orders open only while InProduction from a Published listing; replaced in v1.4 by the price per kg, the floor price and bulk pre-orders while Funding. Stocking today needs boxes = seed_quantity.&lt;br&gt;• Settlement: the Admin triggers the calculation and the engine (SettlementCalculator) computes it. Delivering and FinalOrder are «planned» business phases inside Harvesting, derived from the order states; they are not status values and need no new CHECK value. Not implemented: early liquidation, Rejected → Draft resubmission.&lt;br&gt;• Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;Legend: solid = implemented on develop · dashed grey «planned» = Register v1.4, not in code yet (grey text on a solid transition = planned guard or effect) · dashed orange &quot;(not written by code)&quot; = value allowed by the CHECK constraint but never written · parts removed in v1.4 are not drawn (see Notes and the Index).&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="904" width="1560" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="contribution.status" id="contribution_status"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.9 – State Machine Diagram: contribution.status (Contribution / reservation) + RowAllocation «planned»&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5.1 · states = CHECK values + «planned» · label: trigger [guard] / effect · UC · modified + «planned» (box rows, RowAllocation)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1600" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Source (develop @ 420a379, V001–V017):&lt;/b&gt; FundingController.Reserve/Cancel → FundingService.ReserveAsync/CancelAsync · ContributionPaymentHandler.OnPaidAsync · FundingCloseJob → FundingCloseService · PayoutSendService.SendAsync · &lt;b&gt;Module:&lt;/b&gt; Funding (Thiện)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="58" width="1600" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="&lt;b&gt;stm RowAllocation&lt;/b&gt; «planned»" style="shape=umlFrame;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;pointerEvents=0;width=236;height=28;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;fillColor=#f8fafc;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=14;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="950" y="150" width="660" height="520" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="5" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;separate machine: one RowAllocation per picked box row, following its contribution&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="c4"><mxGeometry x="10" y="34" width="640" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="Reserved" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="250" y="260" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="Confirmed" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="690" y="260" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="Expired" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="250" y="560" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="Refunded" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="690" y="560" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned»&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Held" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;fillColor=#f8fafc;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="c4"><mxGeometry x="70" y="120" width="150" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned»&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Allocated" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;fillColor=#f8fafc;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="c4"><mxGeometry x="430" y="120" width="150" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned»&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Released" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;fillColor=#f8fafc;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="c4"><mxGeometry x="250" y="360" width="150" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=startState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="277" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="768" y="130" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="328" y="666" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="768" y="666" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=startState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="c4"><mxGeometry x="34" y="137" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="c4"><mxGeometry x="493" y="260" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="c4"><mxGeometry x="313" y="465" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="20" value="/ created by&lt;br&gt;reserve&lt;br&gt;(Investor):&lt;br&gt;expires_at =&lt;br&gt;min(+30 min,&lt;br&gt;funding deadline)&lt;br&gt;· UC10, UC11&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» hold the&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;picked box rows&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;(RowAllocation&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;Held)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c13" target="c6"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="21" value="payment webhook [request&lt;br&gt;Pending, amount matches,&lt;br&gt;before expiry] /&lt;br&gt;confirmed_at · UC12&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» rows Allocated&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c7"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="22" value="after(expires_at) or&lt;br&gt;funding close (job)&lt;br&gt;/ QR Expired, void&lt;br&gt;unsigned contract ·&lt;br&gt;UC10&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» rows&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;Released&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;exitX=0.306;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.306;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c8"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="-63" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="23" value="cancel (Investor)&lt;br&gt;[not paid] / QR&lt;br&gt;Cancelled, void&lt;br&gt;unsigned contract ·&lt;br&gt;UC10&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» rows&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;Released&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;exitX=0.694;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.694;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c8"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="62" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="24" value="Refund instruction&lt;br&gt;Succeeded [batch&lt;br&gt;Cancelled, amount =&lt;br&gt;contribution] /&lt;br&gt;refunded_at · UC40&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» also when the&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;batch does not open for&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;a low pre-order ratio;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;rows Released&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c9"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="25" value="batch Closed&lt;br&gt;(capital returned&lt;br&gt;through the&lt;br&gt;settlement line) ·&lt;br&gt;UC39" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c14"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="55" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="26" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c8" target="c15"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="27" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c9" target="c16"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="28" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c17" target="c10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="29" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned»&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;contribution&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;Confirmed / the row&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;belongs to this&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;investor · UC12&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c10" target="c11"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="30" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned»&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;contribution&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;Expired (timeout&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;or cancel) / row&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;free again · UC10&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c10" target="c12"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="31" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» batch&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;not opened&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;(funding close&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;job) /&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;contribution&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;refund created ·&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;UC10&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c11" target="c12"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="32" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned»&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;batch Closed&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c11" target="c18"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="33" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c12" target="c19"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="34" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Created by reserve (Investor) only if: eKYC Verified, risk disclosure acknowledged, batch Funding and window open, min_contribution ≤ amount ≤ remaining capital, no other active hold in the batch; «planned» the picked box rows are free; amount = Σ (boxes in each row × Standard Cost per box); the minimum is one row's capital (the admin minimum contribution stays as a floor for a row's capital) (UC10, UC11).&lt;br&gt;• Capital close snapshots Confirmed contributions into capital_share (trigger trg_capital_share_immutable); the row itself stays Confirmed. Investors pay in full once before the batch opens, no instalments (Register v1.4) — as on develop.&lt;br&gt;• A webhook arriving after Expired is booked as LatePayment with an automatic Refund instruction (TL-10). Cancel = expire now (the CHECK has no Cancelled value).&lt;br&gt;• «planned» RowAllocation (status Held, Allocated, Released): a BoxRow belongs to the batch (its boxes grouped by physical_slot.row_code); each picked row is Held during the 30-minute reservation, Allocated when the contribution is Confirmed (a confirmed row belongs to exactly one investor; at most one active allocation per row) and Released when the contribution expires or is refunded. No table yet.&lt;br&gt;• Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;Legend: solid = implemented on develop · dashed grey «planned» = Register v1.4, not in code yet (grey text on a solid transition = planned guard or effect) · dashed orange &quot;(not written by code)&quot; = value allowed by the CHECK constraint but never written · parts removed in v1.4 are not drawn (see Notes and the Index).&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="716" width="1560" height="165" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="investment_contract.status" id="investment_contract_status"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.10 – State Machine Diagram: investment_contract.status (Contract)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5.1 · states = CHECK values + «planned» · label: trigger [guard] / effect · UC · kept (template content «planned»)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1600" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Source (develop @ 420a379, V001–V017):&lt;/b&gt; ContractsController.Create/Sign/OfflineUpload → ContractService.CreateForContributionAsync/SignAsync/UploadOfflineAsync · ContractVoiding.VoidUnsignedAsync · &lt;b&gt;Module:&lt;/b&gt; Contracts (Thiện)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="58" width="1600" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="Draft" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="330" y="240" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="OperatorSigned" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="780" y="240" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="FullySigned" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1230" y="240" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="Void" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="780" y="550" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=startState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="257" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1480" y="257" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="858" y="656" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="11" value="/ created by create&lt;br&gt;contract (Investor): fill&lt;br&gt;CT-2026-01, render PDF,&lt;br&gt;draft_hash · UC14&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» the template&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;carries the loss rule,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;floor price and&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;remuneration tiers&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c8" target="c4"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="12" value="sign (Operator Owner)&lt;br&gt;[contribution still active]&lt;br&gt;/ signature #1 (Viettel,&lt;br&gt;sandbox), new file hash ·&lt;br&gt;UC14" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c5"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="13" value="sign (Investor) [Operator&lt;br&gt;signed first, else 422&lt;br&gt;contract.wrong_signing_order]&lt;br&gt;/ signature #2, final_hash,&lt;br&gt;fully_signed_at · UC14" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c6"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="14" value="offline upload (Admin) [PDF, confirmedBothSigned; also from&lt;br&gt;OperatorSigned] / signing_method OfflineUpload, final_hash ·&lt;br&gt;UC15" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c6"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="420" y="115"/><mxPoint x="1320" y="115"/></Array><mxPoint x="0" y="28" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="15" value="reservation expired or&lt;br&gt;cancelled, or batch&lt;br&gt;Cancelled /&lt;br&gt;ContractVoiding · UC10" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c7"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="16" value="same causes · UC10" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c7"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="17" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="18" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="19" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Created by create contract (Investor) only if: own contribution Reserved (not expired) or Confirmed — contract and VietQR payment run in parallel — batch Funding, an active contract template (UC14).&lt;br&gt;• Every version is stored as contracts/{no}/{sha256}.pdf and re-hashed on download (contract.file_tampered). Void and FullySigned are terminal (contract.void, contract.already_signed). The batch is stocked only when the capital is closed and every contract is FullySigned.&lt;br&gt;• Unchanged by Register v1.4 (sequential signing through Viettel, sandbox). «planned» the loss rule, floor price and remuneration tiers go into the contract template before funding opens (Register v1.4, section 4).&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;Legend: solid = implemented on develop · dashed grey «planned» = Register v1.4, not in code yet (grey text on a solid transition = planned guard or effect) · dashed orange &quot;(not written by code)&quot; = value allowed by the CHECK constraint but never written · parts removed in v1.4 are not drawn (see Notes and the Index).&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="706" width="1560" height="105" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="payment_request.status" id="payment_request_status"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.11 – State Machine Diagram: payment_request.status (VietQR collection)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5.1 · states = CHECK values + «planned» · label: trigger [guard] / effect · UC · modified (purposes)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1600" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Source (develop @ 420a379, V001–V017):&lt;/b&gt; PaymentRequestService.CreateAsync · PaymentWebhookService.ProcessAsync · FundingCloseService · ReservationExpiryService · FundingService.CancelAsync · OrderCancellationService · &lt;b&gt;Module:&lt;/b&gt; Payments (Thiện)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="58" width="1600" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="Pending" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="240" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="Paid" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="960" y="240" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="Expired" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="550" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="Cancelled" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="960" y="550" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=startState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="257" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1230" y="257" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="498" y="656" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1038" y="656" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="12" value="/ created by a payment&lt;br&gt;request: VietQR via the&lt;br&gt;payment intermediary,&lt;br&gt;reference code, expires_at ·&lt;br&gt;UC12&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» PreOrderBalance =&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;weighedKg × price per kg −&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;deposit, issued at delivery&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c8" target="c4"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="13" value="webhook [provider_txn_id new,&lt;br&gt;amount matches, before&lt;br&gt;expires_at] / transaction&lt;br&gt;Matched, purpose handler ·&lt;br&gt;UC12" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c5"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="14" value="after(expires_at)&lt;br&gt;(funding close /&lt;br&gt;reservation expiry jobs)&lt;br&gt;or late webhook / late&lt;br&gt;money → Refund&lt;br&gt;instruction · UC12" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c6"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="15" value="contribution or order&lt;br&gt;cancelled, or batch&lt;br&gt;Cancelled · UC10,&lt;br&gt;UC54, UC55&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» a pending&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;balance request is&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;cancelled when the&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;order is forfeited&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c7"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="16" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="17" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="18" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="19" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Created by a payment request only if: purpose Contribution, PreOrderDeposit, PreOrderBalance or OrderPayment (OfftakeDeposit and OfftakePayment are removed in v1.4); «planned» OrderPayment is reused by invoiced sales and the final order instead of retail checkout (UC12).&lt;br&gt;• Idempotency: provider_txn_id is UNIQUE; a repeated webhook is acknowledged without a second booking (TL-10). An amount mismatch keeps the request Pending and books the transaction Unmatched for manual reconciliation (UC40).&lt;br&gt;• Purposes OfftakeDeposit and OfftakePayment are removed in v1.4 (still in code and in ck_payment_request_purpose), so they are not drawn; OrderPayment stays, reused by invoiced sales (Figure 4.18) instead of retail checkout. Gap: no job expires PreOrderBalance requests (due after 48 h); only a late webhook moves them to Expired.&lt;br&gt;• Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;Legend: solid = implemented on develop · dashed grey «planned» = Register v1.4, not in code yet (grey text on a solid transition = planned guard or effect) · dashed orange &quot;(not written by code)&quot; = value allowed by the CHECK constraint but never written · parts removed in v1.4 are not drawn (see Notes and the Index).&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="706" width="1560" height="135" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="payment_instruction.status" id="payment_instruction_status"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.12 – State Machine Diagram: payment_instruction.status (refund, disbursement, payout)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5.1 · states = CHECK values + «planned» · label: trigger [guard] / effect · UC · corrected to code (Sent not written)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1600" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Source (develop @ 420a379, V001–V017):&lt;/b&gt; RefundService.CreateRefundAsync · DisbursementService.ReleaseAsync · SettlementPayoutService.ApproveAsync/SendPayoutsAsync · AdminPaymentsController.Send → PayoutSendService.SendAsync · &lt;b&gt;Module:&lt;/b&gt; Payments (Thiện)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="58" width="1600" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="Created" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="260" y="340" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="Sent&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;(not written by code)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;dashed=1;strokeColor=#9a3412;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="140" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="Succeeded" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1140" y="340" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="Failed" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="570" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="Disputed&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;(not written by code)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;dashed=1;strokeColor=#9a3412;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1140" y="660" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=startState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="357" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1420" y="357" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="11" value="/ created by a&lt;br&gt;refund, a tranche&lt;br&gt;release or a&lt;br&gt;settlement&lt;br&gt;approval · UC18,&lt;br&gt;UC39&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» Refund&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;of customer&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;deposits when the&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;batch does not&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;open, and of a&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;negative delivery&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;balance&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c9" target="c4"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="12" value="send (Admin) [batch account Open,&lt;br&gt;payee resolved] / gateway accepted:&lt;br&gt;provider_transaction Out, sent_at,&lt;br&gt;completed_at · UC40" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c6"><mxGeometry x="-0.320" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="13" value="send (Admin) /&lt;br&gt;gateway rejected,&lt;br&gt;sent_at · UC40" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c7"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="14" value="resend (Admin) /&lt;br&gt;same reference&lt;br&gt;CHI{id} · UC40" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c6"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="15" value="resend (Admin) / rejected&lt;br&gt;again · UC40" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c7"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="808" y="666"/><mxPoint x="772" y="666"/></Array><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="16" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;send (Admin)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;[asynchronous&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;provider] / sent_at,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;wait for the callback&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;(not written by code)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#9a3412;fontColor=#9a3412;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c5"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="17" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;provider&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;callback [done]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;/ completed_at&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;(not written by&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;code)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#9a3412;fontColor=#9a3412;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c6"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="18" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;provider&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;callback&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;[failed] (not&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;written by&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;code)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#9a3412;fontColor=#9a3412;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c7"><mxGeometry x="0.320" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="19" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;dispute notice&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;(provider)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;(not written&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;by code)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#9a3412;fontColor=#9a3412;exitX=0.306;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.306;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c8"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="-45" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="20" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;dispute closed&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;(provider)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;(not written&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;by code)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#9a3412;fontColor=#9a3412;exitX=0.694;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.694;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c8" target="c6"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="47" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="21" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="22" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Created by a refund, a tranche release or a settlement approval only if: type Refund, Disbursement, Payout or TaxPayment; amount &amp;gt; 0 (UC18, UC39).&lt;br&gt;• The sandbox gateway answers synchronously: code goes Created → Succeeded or Failed and only sets sent_at. Sent and Disputed are allowed by the CHECK but never written (a known gap).&lt;br&gt;• On Succeeded: a Refund of a cancelled batch's contribution sets it Refunded; the last investor Payout closes the settlement and the batch (SettlementClosing.CloseIfPaidAsync); an order refund changes only the instruction.&lt;br&gt;• Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;Legend: solid = implemented on develop · dashed grey «planned» = Register v1.4, not in code yet (grey text on a solid transition = planned guard or effect) · dashed orange &quot;(not written by code)&quot; = value allowed by the CHECK constraint but never written · parts removed in v1.4 are not drawn (see Notes and the Index).&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="746" width="1560" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="disbursement_tranche.status" id="disbursement_tranche_status"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.13 – State Machine Diagram: disbursement_tranche.status (milestone disbursement)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5.1 · states = CHECK values + «planned» · label: trigger [guard] / effect · UC · corrected to code&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1600" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Source (develop @ 420a379, V001–V017):&lt;/b&gt; BatchReviewService.ApproveAsync (create) · DisbursementsController → DisbursementService.RequestAsync/ReleaseAsync/RequestExplanationAsync/BlockAsync · TrancheScheduleJob · &lt;b&gt;Module:&lt;/b&gt; Payments (Thiện) · created by Batches (Viên)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="58" width="1600" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="Planned" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="220" y="270" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="Requested" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="680" y="270" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="Released" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="270" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="NeedsExplanation" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="680" y="610" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="Blocked" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="610" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=startState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="287" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1420" y="287" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1420" y="627" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="12" value="/ created on&lt;br&gt;batch&lt;br&gt;approval: one&lt;br&gt;row per&lt;br&gt;tranche plan ·&lt;br&gt;UC08" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c9" target="c4"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="13" value="request (Owner) [previous tranche&lt;br&gt;Released, planned date reached; T1:&lt;br&gt;capital closed and contracts signed;&lt;br&gt;T≥2: stocked, Accepted/Watch evidence&lt;br&gt;since the last tranche, none Flagged;&lt;br&gt;T≥3: harvest date declared] /&lt;br&gt;requested_at · UC18" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c5"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="14" value="release (Admin) [gate&lt;br&gt;re-checked, released total ≤&lt;br&gt;confirmed capital, operator&lt;br&gt;payout account Active] /&lt;br&gt;Disbursement instruction&lt;br&gt;Created, released_at · UC18" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c6"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="15" value="need explanation&lt;br&gt;(Admin) [reason] /&lt;br&gt;explanation_deadline&lt;br&gt;= now + 72 h · UC18" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;exitX=0.306;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.306;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c7"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="-65" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="16" value="request again&lt;br&gt;(Owner) [gate&lt;br&gt;passes] / deadline&lt;br&gt;cleared · UC18" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;exitX=0.694;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.694;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c5"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="57" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="17" value="block (Admin)&lt;br&gt;[reason] · UC18" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c8"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="18" value="block (Admin) [reason] · UC18" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c8"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="19" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="20" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c8" target="c11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="21" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• TrancheScheduleJob resolves planned_date from anchors (FundingReady, Stocked + offset_days) without changing status; AlertJob raises MilestoneDelay for an overdue Planned tranche.&lt;br&gt;• Release needs Requested: after an explanation the Owner requests again (no direct NeedsExplanation → Released). The 72 h deadline is informational — no job blocks automatically (gap). A Blocked tranche stops later tranches; unblocking has no API. Unchanged by Register v1.4.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;Legend: solid = implemented on develop · dashed grey «planned» = Register v1.4, not in code yet (grey text on a solid transition = planned guard or effect) · dashed orange &quot;(not written by code)&quot; = value allowed by the CHECK constraint but never written · parts removed in v1.4 are not drawn (see Notes and the Index).&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="696" width="1560" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="settlement.status" id="settlement_status"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.14 – State Machine Diagram: settlement.status (Settlement)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5.1 · states = CHECK values + «planned» · label: trigger [guard] / effect · UC · modified + «planned» (revenue lines, remuneration tiers)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1600" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Source (develop @ 420a379, V001–V017):&lt;/b&gt; AdminSettlementsController.Calculate/Approve/SendPayouts → SettlementService.CalculateAsync · SettlementPayoutService · SettlementsController.Propose/Feedback/Answer → SettlementReviewService · SettlementClosing · &lt;b&gt;Module:&lt;/b&gt; Settlement (Thiện)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="58" width="1600" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="Draft" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="230" y="310" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="Proposed" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="310" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="Disputed" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="630" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="Approved" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1040" y="310" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="PaidOut" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1400" y="310" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="Closed" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1400" y="630" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=startState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="327" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1478" y="736" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="12" value="/ created by run settlement&lt;br&gt;calculation (Admin triggers,&lt;br&gt;SettlementCalculator&lt;br&gt;computes): Pool = revenue −&lt;br&gt;locked Standard Cost;&lt;br&gt;remuneration = floor(Pool ×&lt;br&gt;operator %) if Pool &amp;gt; 0;&lt;br&gt;largest-remainder lines; loss&lt;br&gt;capped at capital · UC38&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» revenue = Σ&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;RevenueLine {DeliveredOrder,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;InvoicedSale,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;ForfeitedDeposit, FinalOrder};&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;locked cost of the funded&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;boxes only; % from the&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;survival-rate tier&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;(RemunerationTier)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c10" target="c4"><mxGeometry x="-0.320" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="-1" y="153" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="13" value="recalculate (Admin) /&lt;br&gt;revision_no++, lines&lt;br&gt;replaced · UC38" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c4"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="338" y="406"/><mxPoint x="302" y="406"/></Array><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="14" value="propose (Admin) [7 ≤&lt;br&gt;feedbackDays ≤ 14] /&lt;br&gt;proposed_at,&lt;br&gt;feedback_deadline ·&lt;br&gt;UC37" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c5"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="15" value="feedback&lt;br&gt;(Investor) [now ≤&lt;br&gt;feedback_deadline]&lt;br&gt;/ feedback Open ·&lt;br&gt;UC36" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;exitX=0.333;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.333;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c6"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="-61" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="16" value="answer the last&lt;br&gt;Open feedback&lt;br&gt;(Admin) / Answered&lt;br&gt;or Unresolved ·&lt;br&gt;UC36" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;exitX=0.667;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.667;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c5"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="62" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="17" value="more feedback&lt;br&gt;(Investor) ·&lt;br&gt;UC36" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c6"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="604" y="678"/><mxPoint x="604" y="642"/></Array><mxPoint x="-48" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="18" value="recalculate (Admin) [not Approved; also from Disputed] /&lt;br&gt;revision_no++, proposal cleared · UC38" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c4"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="700" y="185"/><mxPoint x="300" y="185"/></Array><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="19" value="approve (Admin) [deadline&lt;br&gt;passed, no Open feedback,&lt;br&gt;batch account Open] / lock&lt;br&gt;(trg_settlement_locked);&lt;br&gt;TaxPayment, operator&lt;br&gt;Payout, investor Payouts&lt;br&gt;Created · UC39" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c7"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="20" value="last investor&lt;br&gt;Payout Succeeded,&lt;br&gt;or no positive&lt;br&gt;line · UC40" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c8"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="21" value="/ batch Closed,&lt;br&gt;closed_at (same&lt;br&gt;transaction) ·&lt;br&gt;UC40" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c8" target="c9"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="22" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c9" target="c11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="23" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Created by run settlement calculation (Admin triggers, SettlementCalculator computes) only if: batch Harvesting or Settlement, capital shares exist, a Locked Standard Cost exists (UC38).&lt;br&gt;• uq_settlement_batch_id: one settlement per batch, rewritten in place before approval. Approve is refused with settlement.not_proposed, settlement.open_feedback or settlement.window_open; afterwards the trigger blocks every update (409 settlement.locked).&lt;br&gt;• Code revenue = Completed orders + forfeited offtake deposits − resolved complaint refunds (v_batch_actual_revenue); remuneration uses a fixed operator_share_pct. «planned» four RevenueLine types; forfeited BulkPreOrder deposits counted once; customer refunds settled before the Pool; remuneration cut by survival tier (thresholds approved with the batch, UC08).&lt;br&gt;• «planned» survival rate = 1 − dead crabs during farming ÷ crabs first stocked in the funded boxes; a restocked crab that dies counts as dead; deaths in transit do not count (they lower revenue instead). The full locked Standard Cost of the funded boxes is always deducted: savings, including an unused mortality reserve, stay with the Operator and never enter the Pool; unspent capital is returned only after early liquidation.&lt;br&gt;• The Admin triggers the calculation and the engine computes it. Loss rule unchanged: each investor loses at most the capital contributed; a loss beyond that is borne by the Operator, never by the platform.&lt;br&gt;• Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;Legend: solid = implemented on develop · dashed grey «planned» = Register v1.4, not in code yet (grey text on a solid transition = planned guard or effect) · dashed orange &quot;(not written by code)&quot; = value allowed by the CHECK constraint but never written · parts removed in v1.4 are not drawn (see Notes and the Index).&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="786" width="1560" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="settlement_feedback.status" id="settlement_feedback_status"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.15 – State Machine Diagram: settlement_feedback.status (Investor feedback)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5.1 · states = CHECK values + «planned» · label: trigger [guard] / effect · UC · kept&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1600" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Source (develop @ 420a379, V001–V017):&lt;/b&gt; SettlementsController.Feedback/Answer → SettlementReviewService.FeedbackAsync/AnswerAsync · &lt;b&gt;Module:&lt;/b&gt; Settlement (Thiện)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="58" width="1600" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="Open" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="440" y="250" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="Answered" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="960" y="250" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="Unresolved" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="960" y="550" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="Withdrawn&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;(not written by code)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;dashed=1;strokeColor=#9a3412;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="440" y="550" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=startState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="110" y="267" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1230" y="267" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1230" y="567" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="518" y="656" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="12" value="/ created by feedback&lt;br&gt;(Investor): settlement →&lt;br&gt;Disputed · UC36" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c8" target="c4"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="13" value="answer (Admin) [unresolved =&lt;br&gt;false] / response,&lt;br&gt;responded_at · UC36" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c5"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="14" value="answer (Admin)&lt;br&gt;[unresolved = true] /&lt;br&gt;disagreement kept on the&lt;br&gt;statement · UC36" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c6"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="15" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;withdraw&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;(Investor) (not&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;written by code)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#9a3412;fontColor=#9a3412;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c7"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="16" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="17" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="18" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="19" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Created by feedback (Investor) only if: settlement Proposed or Disputed, now ≤ feedback_deadline, the user is an investor of the batch (UC36).&lt;br&gt;• When no feedback is Open the settlement returns to Proposed; Unresolved does not block approval but is shown on the statement (TL-14). Unchanged by Register v1.4.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;Legend: solid = implemented on develop · dashed grey «planned» = Register v1.4, not in code yet (grey text on a solid transition = planned guard or effect) · dashed orange &quot;(not written by code)&quot; = value allowed by the CHECK constraint but never written · parts removed in v1.4 are not drawn (see Notes and the Index).&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="706" width="1560" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="batch_account.status" id="batch_account_status"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.16 – State Machine Diagram: batch_account.status (dedicated batch account)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5.1 · states = CHECK values + «planned» · label: trigger [guard] / effect · UC · corrected to code (created Open)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1600" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Source (develop @ 420a379, V001–V017):&lt;/b&gt; BatchReviewService.ApproveAsync → IBatchAccountProvisioner.OpenBatchAccountAsy