t;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;closed_at (not&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;written by code)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#9a3412;fontColor=#9a3412;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c8"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="18" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c8" target="c10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="19" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Code inserts the row directly as Open on approval (sandbox provisioner); Requested is only the column default, and Frozen and Closed have no code path.&lt;br&gt;• Every payment_request, provider_transaction and payment_instruction references this account; VietQR collection, deposits, disbursements, refunds and payouts require Open. The platform holds no money: the account sits at the payment intermediary (Register v1.4).&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;Legend: solid = implemented on develop · dashed grey «planned» = Register v1.4, not in code yet (grey text on a solid transition = planned guard or effect) · dashed orange &quot;(not written by code)&quot; = value allowed by the CHECK constraint but never written · parts removed in v1.4 are not drawn (see Notes and the Index).&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="776" width="1560" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="sales_order.status (BulkPreOrder)" id="sales_order_status_