155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c7"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="31" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» cancel&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;(Customer or&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;Investor) [batch&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;opened] / deposit&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;forfeited:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;RevenueLine&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;ForfeitedDeposit ·&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;UC54, UC55&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;exitX=0.765;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.353;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c11"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="59" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="32" value="ship (Operator)&lt;br&gt;[ETA within 7&lt;br&gt;days] / carrier,&lt;br&gt;vehicle, driver&lt;br&gt;(information&lt;br&gt;only) · UC29" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c8"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="33" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» deliver: record&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;weighedKg and transitLossKg&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;(Operator) / balance QR =&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;weighedKg × price per kg −&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;deposit; if negative, refund&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;the difference · UC29&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c8" target="c8"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1347" y="222"/><mxPoint x="1383" y="222"/></Array><mxPoint x="0" y="-49" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="34" value="deliver (Operator) or&lt;br&gt;receive (Customer) /&lt;br&gt;delivered_at, crabs Sold&lt;br&gt;(today in code) · UC29,&lt;br&gt;UC30&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» v1.4: on the&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;balance webhook [amount&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;= balance] / paid_at,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;Invoice issued&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c8" target="c12"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="77" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="35" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» refuse delivery or&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;not pay the balance (Customer)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;/ deposit forfeited, balance&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;QR Cancelled; crabs back to&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;stock for an InvoicedSale&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;(saleReason ForfeitResale) ·&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;UC30, UC54&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;exitX=0.12;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c8" target="c11"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="36" value="after(return window)&lt;br&gt;[no active&lt;br&gt;complaint] /&lt;br&gt;completed_at, counts&lt;br&gt;as revenue · UC30&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned»&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;RevenueLine&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;DeliveredOrder&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c12" target="c14"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="72" y="-9" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="37" value="return in window&lt;br&gt;(Customer) or approved&lt;br&gt;by the Operator, or&lt;br&gt;complaint refund = total&lt;br&gt;(Admin) [batch not&lt;br&gt;settled] / Refund of&lt;br&gt;everything paid · UC31,&lt;br&gt;UC32" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c12" target="c13"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="38" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c10" target="c17"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="39" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c11" target="c18"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="40" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c13" target="c19"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="41" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c14" target="c20"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="42" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Created by place bulk pre-order (Customer or Investor) only if: the user is not the batch's Operator or one of its members; enough crabs left on the batch capacity (no overselling); «planned» batch Funding, crab count (or kg) ≥ the minimum order quantity, address within the farm's delivery radius, crabs left in the batch's PreOrderQuota (UC27).&lt;br&gt;• Deposit rules «planned» (UC55 Cancel Bulk Pre-order, UC54 Forfeit Deposit, Sequence 4.58): (a) a Customer who cancels after paying the deposit while the batch is Funding goes to Cancelled and the deposit is kept; it is forfeited if the batch opens, and a cancel after the batch opened (Confirmed) is forfeited at once; (b) if the batch does not open, every paid deposit is refunded, including those of cancelled orders; (c) refusing the delivery or not paying the balance forfeits the deposit and the crabs are resold through an InvoicedSale (ForfeitResale, Figure 4.18); (d) cancelling before paying the deposit (PendingPayment) costs nothing.&lt;br&gt;• «planned» v1.4: order_type BulkPreOrder by crab count (or kg) from a minimum quantity while the batch is Funding (no listing); price per kg locked at funding; delivery within the farm radius; the order QR code is issued when the Operator prepares the delivery note; deliver records weighedKg (live crabs the Customer accepts, dead or spoiled crabs left out) and transitLossKg (recorded only) and issues the balance QR; the balance payment moves the order to Delivered and issues its Invoice, receive then only records received_at (Sequence 4.57); a forfeited deposit becomes RevenueLine ForfeitedDeposit (counted once).&lt;br&gt;• Today in code (removed in v1.4, not drawn): order_type PreOrder from a Published listing while the batch is InProduction, by kg; the balance is issued when the batch is Harvesting and paid before packing (DepositPaid → Paid, the Paid value of ck_sales_order_status, also used by retail checkout); packing scans crab tags (Paid → Packed). Gaps: DepositPaid never expires and cannot be cancelled (422 order.cannot_cancel); forfeited pre-order deposits are not in v_batch_actual_revenue. An active complaint (Figure 4.19) blocks completion and returns.&lt;br&gt;• Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;Legend: solid = implemented on develop · dashed grey «planned» = Register v1.4, not in code yet (grey text on a solid transition = planned guard or effect) · dashed orange &quot;(not written by code)&quot; = value allowed by the CHECK constraint but never written · parts removed in v1.4 are not drawn (see Notes and the Index).&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="846" width="1560" height="225" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="sales_order.status (InvoicedSale | FinalOrder)" id="sales_order_status__InvoicedSale___FinalOrder_"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.18 – State Machine Diagram: sales_order.status — InvoicedSale | FinalOrder «planned»&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5.1 · states = CHECK values + «planned» · label: trigger [guard] / effect · UC · new, «planned» (no code)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1600" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Source (develop @ 420a379, V001–V017):&lt;/b&gt; none on develop — planned InvoicedSalesController → InvoicedSaleService.RecordInvoicedSaleAsync/RecordFinalOrderAsync · InvoicedSalePaymentHandler.OnPaidAsync · FinalOrderReminderJob (Sequence 4.59, 4.60) · &lt;b&gt;Module:&lt;/b&gt; Orders (Nhân) · Settlement (Thiện)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="58" width="1600" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="303" y="277" width="34" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="PendingPayment&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» entry / Invoice issued, crabs Sold, VietQR (OrderPayment)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="600" y="260" width="260" height="69" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="Completed" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="270" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=startState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="282" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1410" y="287" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="9" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» / created by&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;record invoiced sale&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;(UC50) or record final&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;order (UC51)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;(Operator) · UC50,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;UC51&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c4"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="10" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» [InvoicedSale: saleReason LowGrade or&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;ForfeitResale] · UC50&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.385;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c5"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="320" y="145"/><mxPoint x="700" y="145"/></Array><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="11" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» [FinalOrder: sales window closed&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;(SalesWindowDays), price per kg ≥ floor price, one&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;per batch] · UC51&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.385;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c5"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="320" y="440"/><mxPoint x="700" y="440"/></Array><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="12" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» buyer payment&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;webhook (OrderPayment)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;[amount = invoice] /&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;paid_at; RevenueLine&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;InvoicedSale or&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;FinalOrder · UC50, UC51&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c6"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="13" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="14" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Created by record invoiced sale (UC50) or record final order (UC51) (Operator) only if: «planned» batch Harvesting; crabs InStock from harvested boxes and not on another order; LowGrade = weak, watery or frozen crabs; ForfeitResale = crabs released by a forfeited order (Figure 4.17); a final order only for leftover crabs and only once per batch (UC50, UC51).&lt;br&gt;• Whole machine «planned»: no invoiced sale, Invoice or final order on develop. It reuses values of ck_sales_order_status and the payment purpose OrderPayment; order_type BulkPreOrder, InvoicedSale and FinalOrder and the column saleReason (LowGrade, ForfeitResale) need new CHECK values (code: Retail, PreOrder, Offtake).&lt;br&gt;• Lifecycle as in Sequence 4.59 and 4.60: recording the sale issues the Invoice and marks the crabs Sold (Figure 4.23); the buyer pays into the batch account and the order becomes Completed, counted as RevenueLine InvoicedSale or FinalOrder. The final order is the only sale after the sales window and is never below the floor price published before funding (research invariant). The buyer and its resale channel are outside the system.&lt;br&gt;• Open point for Nhân and Thiện: the sequences define no cancel or expiry path, so an unpaid invoice stays PendingPayment (its VietQR request can expire, Figure 4.11) until it is settled by hand.&lt;br&gt;• Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;Legend: solid = implemented on develop · dashed grey «planned» = Register v1.4, not in code yet (grey text on a solid transition = planned guard or effect) · dashed orange &quot;(not written by code)&quot; = value allowed by the CHECK constraint but never written · parts removed in v1.4 are not drawn (see Notes and the Index).&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="490" width="1560" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="complaint.status" id="complaint_status"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.19 – State Machine Diagram: complaint.status (Order complaint)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5.1 · states = CHECK values + «planned» · label: trigger [guard] / effect · UC · kept (regrouped)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1600" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Source (develop @ 420a379, V001–V017):&lt;/b&gt; ComplaintsController.Create/Respond → ComplaintService.SubmitAsync/RespondAsync · ComplaintEscalationJob → EscalateOverdueAsync · AdminComplaintsController.Resolve → ResolveAsync · &lt;b&gt;Module:&lt;/b&gt; Orders (Nhân)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="58" width="1600" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="&lt;b&gt;Active&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#475569&quot;&gt;grouping, not a status value: an active complaint&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#3730a3;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fontSize=14;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="210" y="150" width="820" height="510" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="Open" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="c4"><mxGeometry x="90" y="230" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="OperatorResponded" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="c4"><mxGeometry x="530" y="95" width="200" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="Escalated" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="c4"><mxGeometry x="530" y="380" width="200" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="Resolved" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1250" y="275" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="Rejected" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1250" y="525" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=startState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="396" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=startState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="c4"><mxGeometry x="26" y="247" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1500" y="292" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1500" y="542" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="14" value="/ created by&lt;br&gt;submit return&lt;br&gt;or complaint&lt;br&gt;(Customer) ·&lt;br&gt;UC31" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c10" target="c4"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="15" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c11" target="c5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="16" value="respond (Operator) /&lt;br&gt;operator_response,&lt;br&gt;evidence · UC32" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c6"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="17" value="after(24 h)&lt;br&gt;(escalation job) /&lt;br&gt;escalated_at · UC32" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c7"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="18" value="respond (Operator)&lt;br&gt;· UC32" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c6"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="19" value="resolve (Admin)&lt;br&gt;[Refund,&lt;br&gt;Compensation or&lt;br&gt;Replacement] /&lt;br&gt;Refund instruction;&lt;br&gt;refund = total →&lt;br&gt;order Returned ·&lt;br&gt;UC32" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c8"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="20" value="resolve (Admin)&lt;br&gt;[Rejected or&lt;br&gt;NoAction] · UC32" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c9"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="21" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c8" target="c12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="22" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c9" target="c13"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="23" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Created by submit return or complaint (Customer) only if: order Shipping, Delivered or Completed within the return window, no active complaint on the order (UC31).&lt;br&gt;• Active groups Open, OperatorResponded and Escalated: an active complaint blocks automatic order completion and customer returns; resolve applies from any of them.&lt;br&gt;• Resolved refunds are deducted from the batch's actual revenue before the Revenue Pool is computed. Kept in Register v1.4 (complaints on delivered BulkPreOrders within the return window).&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;Legend: solid = implemented on develop · dashed grey «planned» = Register v1.4, not in code yet (grey text on a solid transition = planned guard or effect) · dashed orange &quot;(not written by code)&quot; = value allowed by the CHECK constraint but never written · parts removed in v1.4 are not drawn (see Notes and the Index).&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="686" width="1560" height="105" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="operator.status" id="operator_status"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.20 – State Machine Diagram: operator.status (Farm operator)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5.1 · states = CHECK values + «planned» · label: trigger [guard] / effect · UC · kept&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1600" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Source (develop @ 420a379, V001–V017):&lt;/b&gt; OperatorsController.Create/Update/Submit → OperatorService · AdminOperatorsController.Approve/Reject/Suspend → OperatorReviewService.DecideAsync · &lt;b&gt;Module:&lt;/b&gt; Operators (Viên)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="58" width="1600" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="Draft" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="280" y="270" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="Submitted" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="270" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="Approved" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="270" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="Rejected" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="570" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="Suspended" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="570" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=startState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="287" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="798" y="676" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1238" y="676" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="12" value="/ created by create&lt;br&gt;profile (Active&lt;br&gt;user):&lt;br&gt;operator_member&lt;br&gt;Owner, role&lt;br&gt;OperatorMember ·&lt;br&gt;UC04" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c9" target="c4"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="13" value="edit profile (Owner or Staff)&lt;br&gt;· UC04" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c4"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="352" y="234"/><mxPoint x="388" y="234"/></Array><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="14" value="submit (Owner) [legal&lt;br&gt;name, tax code,&lt;br&gt;registration no., farm&lt;br&gt;address filled] /&lt;br&gt;submitted_at · UC04" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c5"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="15" value="approve (Admin)&lt;br&gt;[approvedSlotCapacity ≥ 0]&lt;br&gt;/ approved_at, approved_by&lt;br&gt;· UC05" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c6"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="16" value="reject (Admin)&lt;br&gt;[reason] ·&lt;br&gt;UC05" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c7"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="17" value="edit profile&lt;br&gt;(no resubmit&lt;br&gt;path) · UC04" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c7"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="684" y="618"/><mxPoint x="684" y="582"/></Array><mxPoint x="-43" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="18" value="suspend (Admin)&lt;br&gt;[reason] /&lt;br&gt;existing batches&lt;br&gt;untouched · UC05" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c8"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="19" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="20" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c8" target="c11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="21" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Created by create profile (Active user) only if: the user is not yet a member of an operator (UC04).&lt;br&gt;• Approved is required by every write in Boxes, Batches (incl. admin approval), Stocking, Production logs, Box events, Harvest and Evidence upload.&lt;br&gt;• Gap: a Rejected operator can edit but not resubmit (SubmitAsync requires Draft). Register v1.4: the delivery radius is set per batch (UC07), not on the operator.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;Legend: solid = implemented on develop · dashed grey «planned» = Register v1.4, not in code yet (grey text on a solid transition = planned guard or effect) · dashed orange &quot;(not written by code)&quot; = value allowed by the CHECK constraint but never written · parts removed in v1.4 are not drawn (see Notes and the Index).&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="726" width="1560" height="105" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="physical_slot.status (Box)" id="physical_slot_status__Box_"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.21 – State Machine Diagram: physical_slot.status (Box)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5.1 · states = CHECK values + «planned» · label: trigger [guard] / effect · UC · modified + «planned» (box rows, row-scoped view)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1600" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Source (develop @ 420a379, V001–V017):&lt;/b&gt; BoxesController.Create/Range/Update → BoxService · StockingService.StockAsync · SlotEventService.RecordAsync (ClaimAvailableAsync / ReleaseSlotAsync) · HarvestService.RecordAsync · &lt;b&gt;Module:&lt;/b&gt; Boxes (Viên) · Production, Harvest (Viên)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="58" width="1600" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="Available" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="270" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="Occupied&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» do / box details shown only to the investor of its row (UC53)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» do / device and camera data per box via the ingestion API (UC52)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="980" y="246" width="320" height="98" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="Maintenance" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="590" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=startState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="110" y="287" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="8" value="/ created by&lt;br&gt;register boxes and&lt;br&gt;box rows (Owner):&lt;br&gt;numbered box with&lt;br&gt;its row_code · UC44" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c4"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="9" value="set maintenance&lt;br&gt;(Owner) [no open&lt;br&gt;allocation] · UC44" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;exitX=0.333;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.333;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c6"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="-58" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="10" value="set available&lt;br&gt;(Owner) · UC44" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;exitX=0.667;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.667;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c4"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="52" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="11" value="stocking, restock into the box or&lt;br&gt;relocation target / slot_allocation&lt;br&gt;opened · UC17" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;exitX=1;exitY=0.267;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.408;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c5"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="-28" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="12" value="mortality, relocation source or&lt;br&gt;harvest of its crab /&lt;br&gt;slot_allocation.released_at · UC17,&lt;br&gt;UC22" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;exitX=0;exitY=0.673;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.7;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c4"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="35" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="13" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Created by register boxes and box rows (Owner) only if: operator Approved, box count ≤ approved_slot_capacity, box code unique (UC44).&lt;br&gt;• No final state by design: boxes are never deleted (a box out of use stays in Maintenance). Occupied → Maintenance is refused (422 box.in_use); every claim needs Available. Conditional UPDATEs guard races (409 slot_events.conflict, stocking.slot_conflict, harvest.concurrent_change).&lt;br&gt;• «planned» BoxRow belongs to a batch: the boxes allotted to the batch grouped by physical_slot.row_code (UC07, UC44); investors pick rows when reserving and a confirmed row belongs to exactly one investor (RowAllocation, Figure 4.9). Today row_code is only a layout label and there is no BoxRow table.&lt;br&gt;• Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;Legend: solid = implemented on develop · dashed grey «planned» = Register v1.4, not in code yet (grey text on a solid transition = planned guard or effect) · dashed orange &quot;(not written by code)&quot; = value allowed by the CHECK constraint but never written · parts removed in v1.4 are not drawn (see Notes and the Index).&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="676" width="1560" height="135" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="standard_cost_version.status" id="standard_cost_version_status"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.22 – State Machine Diagram: standard_cost_version.status (Standard Cost)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5.1 · states = CHECK values + «planned» · label: trigger [guard] / effect · UC · modified + «planned» (locked with price per kg and floor price)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1600" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Source (develop @ 420a379, V001–V017):&lt;/b&gt; BatchService.SaveCostAsync/SubmitAsync · BatchReviewService.ApproveAsync/RequestRevisionAsync · triggers tr_cost_version_locked, tr_cost_item_locked, tr_cost_plan_locked · DemoLifecycleSeeder · &lt;b&gt;Module:&lt;/b&gt; Batches (Viên)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="58" width="1600" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="Draft" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="260" y="310" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="Submitted" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="310" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="Locked" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1180" y="310" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="Superseded" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="620" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="Approved&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;(not written by the API)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;dashed=1;strokeColor=#9a3412;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1180" y="620" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=startState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="327" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="798" y="145" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1440" y="327" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="798" y="726" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="13" value="/ created by save&lt;br&gt;Standard Cost&lt;br&gt;(Owner):&lt;br&gt;version_no =&lt;br&gt;latest + 1 · UC07" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c9" target="c4"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="14" value="save again (Owner) / items and&lt;br&gt;tranche plan replaced · UC07" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c4"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="332" y="274"/><mxPoint x="368" y="274"/></Array><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="15" value="submit batch (Owner)&lt;br&gt;[MortalityReserve item,&lt;br&gt;complete schedule] /&lt;br&gt;submitted_at · UC07" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c5"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="16" value="approve batch (Admin) /&lt;br&gt;locked_at, approved_by;&lt;br&gt;items and plan immutable&lt;br&gt;(triggers) · UC08&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» locked together&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;with the price per kg and&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;the floor price&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c6"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="17" value="save cost after&lt;br&gt;request revision&lt;br&gt;(Owner) / new Draft&lt;br&gt;version in the same&lt;br&gt;transaction · UC07,&lt;br&gt;UC08" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c7"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="18" value="batch Rejected&lt;br&gt;(version stays&lt;br&gt;Submitted) · UC08" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c10"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="19" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;approve (Admin)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;(not written by&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;the API)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#9a3412;fontColor=#9a3412;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c8"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="20" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;lock (not&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;written by the&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;API)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#9a3412;fontColor=#9a3412;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c8" target="c6"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="21" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="22" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="23" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Created by save Standard Cost (Owner) only if: batch Draft, no Locked version (UC07).&lt;br&gt;• A Locked version is the Standard Cost locked before funding (TL-11) and the settlement input (locked_standard_cost); triggers reject any change to it, its items or its tranche plan. «planned» settlement deducts the locked cost of the funded boxes only.&lt;br&gt;• Approved is never written by the API: only DemoLifecycleSeeder inserts Approved and then sets Locked, so that the triggers accept the items.&lt;br&gt;• Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;Legend: solid = implemented on develop · dashed grey «planned» = Register v1.4, not in code yet (grey text on a solid transition = planned guard or effect) · dashed orange &quot;(not written by code)&quot; = value allowed by the CHECK constraint but never written · parts removed in v1.4 are not drawn (see Notes and the Index).&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="776" width="1560" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="crab_item.status" id="crab_item_status"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.23 – State Machine Diagram: crab_item.status (Crab in a box)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5.1 · states = CHECK values + «planned» · label: trigger [guard] / effect · UC · modified + «planned» (no tags, transit loss, resale)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1600" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Source (develop @ 420a379, V001–V017):&lt;/b&gt; StockingService.StockAsync · SlotEventService.RecordAsync (Mortality, Restocked, Molted, Relocated) · HarvestService.RecordAsync · OrderPackingService.PackAsync · OrderFulfilmentService (MarkCrabsSoldAsync) · &lt;b&gt;Module:&lt;/b&gt; Production, Harvest (Viên) · Orders (Nhân)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="58" width="1600" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="Growing" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="160" y="300" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="InStock" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="580" y="300" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="Packed" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1000" y="300" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="Sold" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1400" y="300" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="Dead" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="160" y="630" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="DeliveredInKind&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;(not written by code)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;dashed=1;strokeColor=#9a3412;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="580" y="630" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="Lost&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;(not written by code)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;dashed=1;strokeColor=#9a3412;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1000" y="630" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=startState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="238" y="120" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="238" y="736" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1478" y="406" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="658" y="736" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1078" y="736" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="16" value="/ created by stocking&lt;br&gt;(Owner) or restock (Owner or&lt;br&gt;Staff): event Stocked · UC17" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c11" target="c4"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="17" value="molted or&lt;br&gt;relocated /&lt;br&gt;event Molted&lt;br&gt;or Relocated&lt;br&gt;· UC17" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c4"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="124" y="348"/><mxPoint x="124" y="312"/></Array><mxPoint x="-43" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="18" value="mortality event&lt;br&gt;(Owner or Staff)&lt;br&gt;[evidence photo of&lt;br&gt;the box] / box&lt;br&gt;Available, event&lt;br&gt;Died, alert by&lt;br&gt;policy · UC17" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c8"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="19" value="harvest record (Owner&lt;br&gt;or Staff) [harvest&lt;br&gt;Open] / weight_g,&lt;br&gt;grade, harvest_record,&lt;br&gt;box Available · UC22&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» recorded per&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;box, no printed tag&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c5"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="20" value="pack for an order&lt;br&gt;(Operator) [grade&lt;br&gt;matches the line] /&lt;br&gt;order_line_id, event&lt;br&gt;Packed (today in code)&lt;br&gt;· UC29&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» replaced in&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v1.4 by Crab.OrderId:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;crabs of a box&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;assigned on the&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;delivery note, order&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;QR code (no tag scan)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c6"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="21" value="order delivered&lt;br&gt;(Operator or&lt;br&gt;Customer) / event&lt;br&gt;Delivered · UC29,&lt;br&gt;UC30&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» v1.4: when&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;the balance is paid&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c7"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="22" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» invoiced sale or final order recorded (Operator) / sold with an&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;Invoice · UC50, UC51&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;exitX=0.333;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.333;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c7"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="640" y="180"/><mxPoint x="1460" y="180"/></Array><mxPoint x="0" y="-20" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="23" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» order Forfeited (delivery refused&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;or balance unpaid) / back to stock for an&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;InvoicedSale (ForfeitResale) · UC50&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;exitX=0.25;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.75;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c5"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1045" y="460"/><mxPoint x="715" y="460"/></Array><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="24" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» died or&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;spoiled in transit /&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;transit loss, not&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;charged (assumed use&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;of Lost) · UC29&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#64748b;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c10"><mxGeometry x="0.160" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="25" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;settle in kind&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;(not written&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;by code)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#9a3412;fontColor=#9a3412;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c9"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="26" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c8" target="c12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="27" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c13"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="28" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c9" target="c14"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="29" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c10" target="c15"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="30" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Created by stocking (Owner) or restock (Owner or Staff) only if: a restock replaces a Dead crab in the same box, before the restock cutoff, with an evidence photo (UC17).&lt;br&gt;• ck_crab_item_harvest_fields: Growing and Dead have no harvest; every other status needs harvest_id, grade_id and weight_g. One Growing crab per allocation; a crab is replaced at most once (ux_crab_item_replacement). «planned» survival rate counts every Dead crab of the funded boxes, restocked crabs included; a crab Lost in transit does not count (Figure 4.14).&lt;br&gt;• Today in code each harvested crab gets a printed tag (crab_tag) and packing scans an Active tag; removed in v1.4 (per-box harvest record and order QR code, UC33). Lost and DeliveredInKind are allowed by the CHECK but never written on develop; DeliveredInKind has no v1.4 use.&lt;br&gt;• Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;Legend: solid = implemented on develop · dashed grey «planned» = Register v1.4, not in code yet (grey text on a solid transition = planned guard or effect) · dashed orange &quot;(not written by code)&quot; = value allowed by the CHECK constraint but never written · parts removed in v1.4 are not drawn (see Notes and the Index).&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="786" width="1560" height="135" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="harvest.lifecycle_status" id="harvest_lifecycle_status"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.24 – State Machine Diagram: harvest.lifecycle_status (Harvest session)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5.1 · states = CHECK values + «planned» · label: trigger [guard] / effect · UC · modified + «planned» (per box, no tags)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1600" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Source (develop @ 420a379, V001–V017):&lt;/b&gt; HarvestController.Start/Record/Complete → HarvestService.StartAsync/RecordAsync/CompleteAsync (V016) · &lt;b&gt;Module:&lt;/b&gt; Harvest (Viên)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="58" width="1600" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="Open" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="480" y="290" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="Completed" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1040" y="290" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=startState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="120" y="307" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1300" y="307" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="8" value="/ created by start&lt;br&gt;harvest (Owner): batch&lt;br&gt;→ Harvesting,&lt;br&gt;harvest_started_at ·&lt;br&gt;UC22" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c4"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="9" value="record a box (Owner or Staff) [crab&lt;br&gt;Growing in this batch] / harvest_record&lt;br&gt;snapshot, counts and weight · UC22&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» per box, without printing a&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;crab tag&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c4"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="552" y="254"/><mxPoint x="588" y="254"/></Array><mxPoint x="0" y="-42" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="10" value="complete (Owner) [expected&lt;br&gt;revision] / completed_at,&lt;br&gt;grade summaries · UC22&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» harvested crabs&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;assigned to Confirmed&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;pre-orders on their delivery&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;notes&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c5"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="11" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="12" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Created by start harvest (Owner) only if: batch InProduction or Harvesting, no Open session (an Open session is reused) (UC22).&lt;br&gt;• One Open session per batch (ux_harvest_open_batch); start reuses it; requests are idempotent by request_id. harvest_record is append-only (trigger). Rows created before V016 have lifecycle_status NULL: read-only history, not a business state.&lt;br&gt;• Today in code each record prints a crab tag and completion syncs listing stock per grade; both removed in v1.4. «planned» each delivery order carries a QR code, issued when the Operator prepares the delivery note (assigning the crabs of the boxes to the order), that traces it to the batch and its boxes (OrderQrCode, UC33).&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;Legend: solid = implemented on develop · dashed grey «planned» = Register v1.4, not in code yet (grey text on a solid transition = planned guard or effect) · dashed orange &quot;(not written by code)&quot; = value allowed by the CHECK constraint but never written · parts removed in v1.4 are not drawn (see Notes and the Index).&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="398.5" width="1560" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="app_user.status" id="app_user_status"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.25 – State Machine Diagram: app_user.status (User account)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5.1 · states = CHECK values + «planned» · label: trigger [guard] / effect · UC · kept&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1600" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Source (develop @ 420a379, V001–V017):&lt;/b&gt; AuthController.Register → AuthService.RegisterAsync · AdminAccountsController.Lock/Unlock → AdminAccountService.SetLockedAsync · JwtBearer OnTokenValidated · &lt;b&gt;Module:&lt;/b&gt; Auth (Thiện) · Accounts (Khôi)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="58" width="1600" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="Active" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="280" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="Locked" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="980" y="280" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="PendingVerification&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;(column default, not created by code)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;dashed=1;strokeColor=#9a3412;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="590" width="200" height="69" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=startState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="120" y="297" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="8" value="/ created by&lt;br&gt;register&lt;br&gt;(anonymous): roles&lt;br&gt;Customer (+&lt;br&gt;Investor), JWT&lt;br&gt;issued · UC01" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c4"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="9" value="lock (Admin) [not self, reason] /&lt;br&gt;existing JWTs rejected (401), login 403&lt;br&gt;auth.locked" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;exitX=1;exitY=0.283;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.283;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c5"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="-28" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="10" value="unlock (Admin) [reason]" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;exitX=0;exitY=0.717;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.717;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c4"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="14" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="11" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;lock (Admin) [not&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;self, reason] (not&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;written by code)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#9a3412;fontColor=#9a3412;exitX=1;exitY=0.25;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.25;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c5"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="-28" y="-43" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="12" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;unlock (Admin)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;[locked from&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;PendingVerification]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;(not written by&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9a3412&quot;&gt;code)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;dashed=1;strokeColor=#9a3412;fontColor=#9a3412;exitX=0.6;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.75;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c6"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="37" y="57" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="13" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Created by register (anonymous) only if: email not taken (UC01).&lt;br&gt;• No final state by design: accounts are never deleted and a lock is reversible. Every service re-checks status = Active in the database, not only in the JWT. Lock and unlock belong to admin user management (no UC code).&lt;br&gt;• PendingVerification is the column default only: the lock and unlock code would handle such a user, but no code creates one. Unchanged by Register v1.4.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;Legend: solid = implemented on develop · dashed grey «planned» = Register v1.4, not in code yet (grey text on a solid transition = planned guard or effect) · dashed orange &quot;(not written by code)&quot; = value allowed by the CHECK constraint but never written · parts removed in v1.4 are not drawn (see Notes and the Index).&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="685" width="1560" height="105" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="investor.verification_status" id="investor_verification_status"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.26 – State Machine Diagram: investor.verification_status (eKYC)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5.1 · states = CHECK values + «planned» · label: trigger [guard] / effect · UC · kept&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1600" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Source (develop @ 420a379, V001–V017):&lt;/b&gt; AccountsController.Verify → AccountService.VerifyIdentityAsync (IEkycProvider) · AdminAccountsController.ApproveException → AdminAccountService.ApproveExceptionAsync · &lt;b&gt;Module:&lt;/b&gt; Accounts (Khôi)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="58" width="1600" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="Unverified" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="280" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="Verified" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="940" y="280" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="Rejected" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="590" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=startState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="110" y="297" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1210" y="297" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="9" value="/ created by&lt;br&gt;register with&lt;br&gt;the role&lt;br&gt;Investor ·&lt;br&gt;UC01" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c4"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="10" value="eKYC passed (Investor)&lt;br&gt;[consent, ID front and back +&lt;br&gt;selfie ≤ 5 MB each, provider&lt;br&gt;Passed] / kyc_check Passed,&lt;br&gt;verified_at; images never&lt;br&gt;stored · UC02" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c5"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="11" value="eKYC failed /&lt;br&gt;kyc_check Failed,&lt;br&gt;failure_reason ·&lt;br&gt;UC02" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c6"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="12" value="retry failed&lt;br&gt;· UC02" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c6"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="344" y="638"/><mxPoint x="344" y="602"/></Array><mxPoint x="-39" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="13" value="retry passed, or approve&lt;br&gt;exception (Admin) [latest&lt;br&gt;check Failed, consent given,&lt;br&gt;not self] / kyc_check&lt;br&gt;ExceptionApproved · UC02,&lt;br&gt;UC06" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c5"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="14" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="15" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• FundingService requires Verified before a reservation (UC10). Only the result and the provider reference are stored (TL-06). A locked user cannot verify. Unchanged by Register v1.4.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;Legend: solid = implemented on develop · dashed grey «planned» = Register v1.4, not in code yet (grey text on a solid transition = planned guard or effect) · dashed orange &quot;(not written by code)&quot; = value allowed by the CHECK constraint but never written · parts removed in v1.4 are not drawn (see Notes and the Index).&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="676" width="1560" height="75" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="payout_account.status" id="payout_account_status"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.27 – State Machine Diagram: payout_account.status (+ name_match_status)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5.1 · states = CHECK values + «planned» · label: trigger [guard] / effect · UC · kept (redrawn with a choice)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1600" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Source (develop @ 420a379, V001–V017):&lt;/b&gt; PaymentProfilesController.SavePayout → PaymentProfileService.SavePayoutAsync (IBankNameMatcher) · ux_payout_active_* (one Active account per owner) · account_no encrypted (V012) · &lt;b&gt;Module:&lt;/b&gt; Accounts (Khôi)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="58" width="1600" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="663" y="233" width="34" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="Active&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#475569&quot;&gt;name_match Matched&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="210" y="460" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="Locked&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#475569&quot;&gt;name_match Mismatched&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1010" y="460" width="200" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="Closed" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="590" y="740" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=startState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="668" y="100" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="9" value="/ created by save account (Investor or&lt;br&gt;Operator Owner): bank name match against the&lt;br&gt;verified name; other accounts Closed · UC03" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c8" target="c4"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="10" value="[holder name&lt;br&gt;matches] / kyc_check&lt;br&gt;BankNameMatch Passed&lt;br&gt;· UC03" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c5"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="11" value="[name does not&lt;br&gt;match] /&lt;br&gt;BankNameMatch Failed&lt;br&gt;(HTTP 200) · UC03" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c6"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="12" value="re-save the same bank and&lt;br&gt;number [if the name&lt;br&gt;changes: no payment&lt;br&gt;instruction yet, else 409&lt;br&gt;payout.holder_immutable] ·&lt;br&gt;UC03" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c4"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="270" y="250"/></Array><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="13" value="re-save with the&lt;br&gt;corrected holder&lt;br&gt;name · UC03" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c4"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1100" y="250"/></Array><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="14" value="save the same&lt;br&gt;bank and number&lt;br&gt;again (row&lt;br&gt;reused) · UC03" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c4"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="15" value="owner saves a&lt;br&gt;different&lt;br&gt;account · UC03" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c7"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="16" value="owner saves a&lt;br&gt;different&lt;br&gt;account · UC03" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c7"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="17" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Created by save account (Investor or Operator Owner) only if: the bank account number is not registered to another owner and there is no admin lock (UC03).&lt;br&gt;• No final state by design: a Closed account can be reused when the same bank and number are saved again. Only Active accounts receive instructions (PayoutSendService, DisbursementService, SettlementPayoutService resolve the active account at send time).&lt;br&gt;• Locked + Matched (an admin lock) blocks every save (403 payout.locked) but no endpoint produces it. Unchanged by Register v1.4.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;Legend: solid = implemented on develop · dashed grey «planned» = Register v1.4, not in code yet (grey text on a solid transition = planned guard or effect) · dashed orange &quot;(not written by code)&quot; = value allowed by the CHECK constraint but never written · parts removed in v1.4 are not drawn (see Notes and the Index).&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="826" width="1560" height="105" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="evidence.review_status" id="evidence_review_status"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.28 – State Machine Diagram: evidence.review_status (Production evidence)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5.1 · states = CHECK values + «planned» · label: trigger [guard] / effect · UC · modified + «planned» (simulator input, row-scoped view)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1600" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Source (develop @ 420a379, V001–V017):&lt;/b&gt; EvidenceController.Upload → EvidenceService.UploadAsync (EvidenceImageProcessor, crab detection module ICrabDetector) · EvidenceReviewController.Verdict → EvidenceReviewService.DecideAsync · EvidenceExplanationsController → EvidenceExplanationService · &lt;b&gt;Module:&lt;/b&gt; Evidence (Khôi)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="58" width="1600" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="313" y="363" width="34" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="Accepted" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="135" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="Watch" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="352" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="Flagged" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1080" y="352" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="Rejected" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1080" y="620" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=startState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="368" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="918" y="152" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1340" y="637" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="12" value="/ created by upload&lt;br&gt;(Operator, live&lt;br&gt;in-app photo):&lt;br&gt;SHA-256 + perceptual&lt;br&gt;hash, crab&lt;br&gt;detection, risk&lt;br&gt;score · UC45&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;«planned» or&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;submitted by the&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;Device &amp;amp; Camera&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;Simulator through&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;the ingestion API&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;(UC52, source&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;FarmApi)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c9" target="c4"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="13" value="[risk &amp;lt; 20]" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c5"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="14" value="[20 ≤ risk &amp;lt; 70]" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c6"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="15" value="[risk ≥ 70] / linked capture request stays Open" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c7"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="330" y="520"/><mxPoint x="1020" y="520"/></Array><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="16" value="verdict Pass&lt;br&gt;(Evidence Reviewer)&lt;br&gt;[not an investor of&lt;br&gt;the batch] · UC47" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c5"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="17" value="verdict&lt;br&gt;NeedMoreEvidence&lt;br&gt;(Reviewer) · UC47" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c7"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="18" value="verdict Fail&lt;br&gt;(Reviewer) · UC47" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c8"><mxGeometry x="-0.160" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="19" value="verdict Pass&lt;br&gt;(Reviewer) · UC47" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c5"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="20" value="verdict Fail&lt;br&gt;(Reviewer) · UC47" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c8"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="21" value="explanation&lt;br&gt;(Operator) /&lt;br&gt;explained_at&lt;br&gt;reopens review for&lt;br&gt;the reviewer who&lt;br&gt;asked · UC48" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c7"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1296" y="364"/><mxPoint x="1296" y="400"/></Array><mxPoint x="61" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="22" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="23" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c8" target="c11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="24" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Created by upload (Operator, live in-app photo) only if: batch Stocked, InProduction or Harvesting; a box of the batch; GPS and capture time present (UC45).&lt;br&gt;• Risk: exact duplicate 100, similar photo 80, captured more than 24 h before receipt 40, crab detection &quot;no crab&quot; ≤ 15 (weak signal). Detection never rejects evidence alone: a human Evidence Reviewer decides, never on a batch they invested in.&lt;br&gt;• The crab detection module only checks whether a crab is in the box; develop runs a no-op detector (result unknown, adds no risk) until the trained module is integrated.&lt;br&gt;• Accepted evidence feeds the investor timeline and tranche gates; Flagged evidence blocks tranche release. «planned» investors see box details only for their own rows (UC53).&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;Legend: solid = implemented on develop · dashed grey «planned» = Register v1.4, not in code yet (grey text on a solid transition = planned guard or effect) · dashed orange &quot;(not written by code)&quot; = value allowed by the CHECK constraint but never written · parts removed in v1.4 are not drawn (see Notes and the Index).&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="706" width="1560" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="capture_request.status" id="capture_request_status"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.29 – State Machine Diagram: capture_request.status (Random capture request)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5.1 · states = CHECK values + «planned» · label: trigger [guard] / effect · UC · kept&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1600" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Source (develop @ 420a379, V001–V017):&lt;/b&gt; CaptureRequestWorker (every 5 min) → CaptureRequestJob.RunAsync · EvidenceService.UploadAsync (captureRequestId) · AlertService.RaiseAsync on expiry · &lt;b&gt;Module:&lt;/b&gt; Evidence (Khôi)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="58" width="1600" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="Open" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="480" y="290" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="Fulfilled" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1040" y="290" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="Expired" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1040" y="590" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=startState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="120" y="307" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1300" y="307" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1300" y="607" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="10" value="/ created by the capture&lt;br&gt;request job: random&lt;br&gt;occupied box, due_at =&lt;br&gt;+120 min · UC45" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c4"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="11" value="Flagged upload linked / request stays Open ·&lt;br&gt;UC45" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c4"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="552" y="254"/><mxPoint x="588" y="254"/></Array><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="12" value="evidence upload with&lt;br&gt;captureRequestId (Operator)&lt;br&gt;[same box, captured within&lt;br&gt;[requested_at, due_at],&lt;br&gt;result not Flagged] /&lt;br&gt;fulfilled_at · UC45" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c5"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="13" value="job [due_at &amp;lt; now] /&lt;br&gt;EvidenceFlag alert&lt;br&gt;(Medium, ack 2 h) ·&lt;br&gt;UC45" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c6"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="14" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="15" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="16" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Created by the capture request job only if: local time ≥ 09:00, batch InProduction, operator Approved, no Open or same-day request, at least one occupied box (UC45).&lt;br&gt;• Random capture requests are the anti-staging control of TL-04: one per eligible batch per day, two-hour response window. Kept in Register v1.4.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;Legend: solid = implemented on develop · dashed grey «planned» = Register v1.4, not in code yet (grey text on a solid transition = planned guard or effect) · dashed orange &quot;(not written by code)&quot; = value allowed by the CHECK constraint but never written · parts removed in v1.4 are not drawn (see Notes and the Index).&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="676" width="1560" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="alert.status" id="alert_status"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.30 – State Machine Diagram: alert.status (Operations alert)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · UML 2.5.1 · states = CHECK values + «planned» · label: trigger [guard] / effect · UC · modified (alert types, regrouped)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1600" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Source (develop @ 420a379, V001–V017):&lt;/b&gt; AlertService.RaiseAsync (callers: AlertJob, SlotEventService, CaptureRequestJob) · AlertsController.Acknowledge · AlertJobWorker (15 min) → AlertJob.RunAsync · AdminAlertsController.Resolve · &lt;b&gt;Module:&lt;/b&gt; Alerts (Khôi)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="58" width="1600" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="&lt;b&gt;Unresolved&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#475569&quot;&gt;grouping, not a status value&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#3730a3;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fontSize=14;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="190" y="150" width="880" height="580" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="Open" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="c4"><mxGeometry x="120" y="230" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="Acknowledged" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="c4"><mxGeometry x="580" y="230" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="Escalated" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#3730a3;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="c4"><mxGeometry x="120" y="470" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="Resolved" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=25;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1300" y="420" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=startState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="428" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=startState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="c4"><mxGeometry x="48" y="247" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1560" y="437" width="24" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="12" value="/ created&lt;br&gt;by raise:&lt;br&gt;ack_deadline&lt;br&gt;= now +&lt;br&gt;ackWithin ·&lt;br&gt;UC19" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c9" target="c4"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="13" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c10" target="c5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="14" value="raise again / message replaced, severity&lt;br&gt;only raised, deadline only shortened ·&lt;br&gt;UC19" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c5"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="382" y="344"/><mxPoint x="418" y="344"/></Array><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="15" value="acknowledge (Operator)&lt;br&gt;[before ack_deadline, note&lt;br&gt;1–300] / acknowledged_at ·&lt;br&gt;UC19" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c6"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="16" value="alert job [ack_deadline&lt;br&gt;&amp;lt; now] or late&lt;br&gt;acknowledge /&lt;br&gt;escalated_at · UC20" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c7"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="17" value="raise again, or&lt;br&gt;acknowledge after&lt;br&gt;escalation / message&lt;br&gt;or note recorded,&lt;br&gt;status unchanged ·&lt;br&gt;UC19" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c7"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="526" y="632"/><mxPoint x="526" y="668"/></Array><mxPoint x="65" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="18" value="resolve (Admin)&lt;br&gt;[note] / kept in&lt;br&gt;the audit log ·&lt;br&gt;UC20" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c8"><mxGeometry x="0.000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="19" value="" style="rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;edgeStyle=none;fontFamily=Segoe UI;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c8" target="c11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="20" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Created by raise only if: no Open or Escalated alert of the same batch and type (otherwise that alert is updated) (UC19).&lt;br&gt;• Types with this lifecycle: Mortality (box events, UC17), MilestoneDelay and DataSilence (alert job), EvidenceFlag (expired capture request). Removed in v1.4 (still in code and in the alert type CHECK), not drawn: WaterQuality, raised by ProductionLogService when the pH, temperature or salinity of a daily log breaks the ProductionThresholdVersion limits, and LowStock, raised by LowStockMonitor for listing stock.&lt;br&gt;• «planned» DataSilence also watches data submitted by the Device &amp;amp; Camera Simulator through the ingestion API (UC52); a new type FinalOrderDue reminds the Operator when the sales window closes (UC51). Acknowledged alerts are never escalated; a new occurrence after Acknowledged or Resolved opens a new row.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;Legend: solid = implemented on develop · dashed grey «planned» = Register v1.4, not in code yet (grey text on a solid transition = planned guard or effect) · dashed orange &quot;(not written by code)&quot; = value allowed by the CHECK constraint but never written · parts removed in v1.4 are not drawn (see Notes and the Index).&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="756" width="1560" height="135" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>